      <p class="dek">Converting between data formats looks like a copy-paste job, but the formats disagree about types, numbers, and structure, so a careless conversion quietly changes your data. Here is what actually happens in the gaps between CSV, JSON, XML, and YAML, and how to move data across them without corrupting it.</p>
