        <li>MDN, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Number/MAX_SAFE_INTEGER" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER</a> (the 2^53 minus 1 safe integer limit).</li>
